{
    "_comment": "TRACE-Kin v6c: Hierarchical Pocket Graph + Multi-Modal Cross-Attention Fusion. MutaPLM per-residue (4096-d) -> Linear(512) -> RWSE graph PE -> GATv2 on contact-map graph (3 layers, 8 heads) -> dynamic pocket identification (top-64 residues) -> MMCAF at pocket level -> hierarchical pooling (gated pocket + global). Ligand: PNA GNN + MoLFormer-XL (768-d) context.",
    "model_version": "v6c",
    "tasks": {
        "regression_task": false,
        "classification_task": false,
        "mclassification_task": 0
    },
    "optimizer": {
